        },
        "quote": "It shall be unlawful for any person providing outdoor service or a takeout service restaurant either on the public street, parkings or public property, to permit any paper, paper containers, dishes, utensils, knives, forks or spoons or anything of like nature to be deposited upon the street, sidewalk, parking, curb or gutter. If all such paper, paper containers, dishes, utensils, knives, forks, spoons or anything of like nature are removed from the public streets, parkings or public property and disposed of daily, such action shall be in full compliance with this section. (Code 1981 § 19-19. Code 1995 § 122-37.)",
